<small>{{#if: {{{standard_scale|}}}|These images are to scale at 0.7 pixels per {{#if: {{{BrE|}}}|millimetre|millimeter}}.}}</small><noinclude>
==Usage==
This template only has 2 parameters. Use
 standard_scale = Anything_that_is_not_an_empty_string
to enable the clause "These images are to scale at 0.7 pixels per millimeter."

 BrE = Anything_that_is_not_an_empty_string
to override '''millimeter''' with '''millimetre'''
